Hello everyone,

In my quest for a MIDI interface today, I happened upon a bargain-bin
Portman PC/P - parallel port MIDI interface.

I saw a driver at portmanlinux.sf.net for the PC/S serial version.
Anyone know anything about this parallel port version?

I've got the cover off - it looks like the main chip on the device is
a 16C550 knockoff.  I suspect it just fudges the levels and timings to
match a parallel port and uses a driver to pull the data off.

If a driver exists, I'd love a pointer.  If not, I'll have to see what
I can get from Midiman.


